{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19102210","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19102210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910221001:1":{"text":"여기가 소문으로만 듣던 외곽 해역...","source_cn":"这就是传说中的外部海域啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06E0040D864C02A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910221002:0":{"text":"이 근처에서 바다 일족이 실종된 적이 있어서 할머니랑 엄마, 모린 언니 모두 여긴 위험하다고 했어. 혼자 오는 것도, 같이 오는 것도 절대 안 된대.","source_cn":"因为有海裔在附近失踪过，阿嬷、妈妈、沫霖姐姐都说这里危...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA5F7595EB720A63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910221003:0":{"text":"이야기는 그렇게 많이 들었는데, 드디어 직접 와 보네. 전에 궁금했던 곳은 전부 가 봐야겠어!","source_cn":"听了那么多有关它的事情，终于能来这里了。我一定要把之前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE96A353E7745AB75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910221004:1":{"text":"엘피라는 외곽 해역에 들어서자마자 바다로 돌아온 물고기처럼 이 동굴 저 동굴을 들락거리고, 해초를 만져 보며 날렵하고 신나게 돌아다녔다.","source_cn":"刚一进入外海，艾菲拉便如同归海的游鱼般，钻钻这个洞窟、...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6AECA2065EBEC86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910221005:1":{"text":"随着她的身影，你谨慎地打量着四周。但与你想象的不同，令家族代表们无比忌惮的这处外部海域，与你们曾去过的围猎地并没有什么太大区别。","source_cn":"随着她的身影，你谨慎地打量着四周。但与你想象的不同，令...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x80B7513530F7957C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910221006:0":{"text":"뭐가 그렇게 신기하다는 거야? 다른 바다랑 똑같기만 한데.","source_cn":"哪值得好奇了？这和其他海不是没两样吗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x587CC12E5471CE98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910221007:0":{"text":"워터라이더를 수리할 만한 특별한 재료도 없잖아. 여기가 말로만 듣던 그 외곽 해역이야?","source_cn":"也没啥能用来修理水行器的特别材料。这就是外海？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x263169D979A2837A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1910221007":{"text":"워터라이더를 수리할 만한 특별한 재료도 없잖아. 여기가 말로만 듣던 그 외곽 해역이야?","source_cn":"也没啥特别的材料。这就是外海？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x263169D979A2837A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910221008:1":{"text":"응. 할머니가 그러셨어. 혼자 밖으로 나간 바다 일족이 가끔 외곽 해역에서 실종되곤 하거든.","source_cn":"阿嬷是这么说的。因为，独自外出的海裔，偶尔会在外部海域失踪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E7FEB08B9F1349D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910221010:1":{"text":"할머니가 그러셨는데, 20년 전에 우리 또래 중에 가장 나이 많던 오빠도 여기서 실종됐대.","source_cn":"阿嬷说，在二十年前，我们这辈最年长的哥哥，就是在这里失踪的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD27DB277017AF4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910221011:1":{"text":"실종이라고? 감당 못 할 만큼 거대한 물고기라도 만난 거 아냐?","source_cn":"失踪？难道撞上解决不了的大鱼怪了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6B4F3A50630D57A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910221012:1":{"text":"처음엔 다들 그렇게 생각했어. 하지만 할머니들이 몇 번이나 찾아 나섰는데도 그런 생물은 없었대.","source_cn":"一开始大家也是这么猜的，但阿嬷她们出来找了好几次，都没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E9137C16E90FF4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910221013:1":{"text":"그리고 우리 바다 일족이 정말 거대한 물고기를 만났다면 잡혀가기 전에 반격이라도 했을걸?","source_cn":"而且，就算我们海裔真的遇到大鱼怪，在被抓走前也一定会反击的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76DB9249686780A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910221014:1":{"text":"그런데 아무리 찾아봐도 싸운 흔적조차 없었대... 오빠가 마치 감쪽같이 사라진 것처럼 말이야.","source_cn":"但阿嬷他们找了又找，这里却连一点搏斗的痕迹也没有……哥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0614835EFE0DA5C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1910221014":{"text":"그런데 아무리 찾아봐도 싸운 흔적조차 없었대... 오빠가 마치 감쪽같이 사라진 것처럼 말이야.","source_cn":"但阿嬷他们找了又找，这里却连一点搏斗的痕迹也没有……哥哥就像凭空消失了一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0614835EFE0DA5C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910221015:1":{"text":"나도 그렇게 생각했어... 하지만 실제로 무슨 일이 있었는지는 아무도 몰라.","source_cn":"我也这么猜过……但谁也不知道事实到底是怎样的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EA4D08A3A92C220","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910221016:1":{"text":"아무튼 전부 말이 안 되는 거잖아. 이상하네.","source_cn":"这也不对，那也说不通，真够玄乎的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AB4E0B2CC8581C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910221017:1":{"text":"맞아... 그 후로는 다들 여기로 사냥을 오지도 않고, 숨겨진 비밀을 조사하지도 않게 됐어.","source_cn":"是呀……之后，大家就不再来这里围猎，也不再调查藏在外海...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x405E92BECF73610B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910221018:1":{"text":"하지만 이렇게 포기하면 안 되잖아!","source_cn":"可我认为，不应该就这样放弃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB7DB4531FF2DEC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1910221019:1":{"text":"난 실종된 가족들이 대체 왜 사라진 건지 알고 싶어서 계속 여기에 와 보고 싶었어. 바다 몬스터가 없었다면 대체 뭐에 당한 걸까? 혹시 아직 찾을 수 있지 않을까?","source_cn":"我一直想来这里看看，我想知道那些失踪的家人到底为什么会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x862CA6DE85DD8BFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1910221020:1":{"text":"...너무 궁금해!","source_cn":"——我很好奇！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x419BCF8C9A46C8DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1910221021:1":{"text":"알았어, 알았다고! 무슨 말인지 알았으니까 그만 물어봐! 이따가 같이 찾아봐 줄게.","source_cn":"行行行！别再问了，咱知道了！咱待会顺便也帮你找找。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5014AE776B94C56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1910221022:1":{"text":"톨란, 고마워! 나...","source_cn":"图澜！谢谢你，我——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5893E8AC3DB22B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1910221023:1":{"text":"질문 금지!","source_cn":"别说话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EBA868CA4705EC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1910221024:1":{"text":"걱정 마, 질문하려는 게 아니라 너희한테 고맙다고 말하려던 거야...","source_cn":"放心，我不是想问问题，我是想向你们表达感谢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x763212D154296E83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1910221025:1":{"text":"조용히 하라고! ...아니, 그러니까 저쪽에서 무슨 소리가 들려!","source_cn":"别说话！……不是，咱是说，那边有动静！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC8B4CA1BFD429DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1910221026:1":{"text":"顺着图澜目光的方向，你们看到了一个被海草缠住的洞窟。","source_cn":"顺着图澜目光的方向，你们看到了一个被海草缠住的洞窟。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x1778FEEF799E6F7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1910221027:1":{"text":"조용히 귀를 기울이니 주변의 소리가 유난히 선명하게 들려왔다. 톨란이 잘못 들은 게 아니었다. 동굴 안에서 희미한 소리가 들려오고 있었다.","source_cn":"安静下来后，周围的声音变得格外清晰。图澜没有听错，洞窟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9882C690C3196589","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1910221028:1":{"text":"끊어질 듯 이어지는 흐느낌은 바람 소리 같기도, 사람이 우는 소리 같기도 했다.","source_cn":"断断续续、呜呜咽咽，好似风声，又好似人哭。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAC7EA11EDEF4136","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1910221029:1":{"text":"하지만 바닷속에는 바람이 불지 않는다.","source_cn":"但海底是没有风的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3871B6BB98DA5FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_t